финанси</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Разходи за икономически дейности</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Пътища, транспорт, енергетика, земеделие, субсидии за фирми.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 mb-10\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">България<!-- -->, <!-- -->2024</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">5,8</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">% от БВП</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Промяна спрямо <!-- -->2023</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1 \">0</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">посоката зависи от контекста</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">ЕС, <!-- -->2024</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-1\">5,3</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">България е над средното за ЕС</p></div></div><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Във времето</h2></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><details class=\"mt-3\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-sm font-semibold text-green\">Цялата история от <!-- -->1995<!-- --> г.</summary><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white mt-2\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div></details></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Какво следва за хората</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато расте</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Повече държавни инвестиции и субсидии.</p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-1\">Когато пада</p><p class=\"text-[15px]\">По-малко.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Свързани показатели</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/statistiki/investment\">Инвестиции</a><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\"> · <!-- -->20,9<!-- --> (<!-- -->2025<!-- -->)</span><p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\">Инвестициите.</p></li></ul></section><section class=\"mb-10\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Какво се движи заедно с него</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Сравняваме годишните промени, а не самите стойности, за да не излизат връзки само защото всичко расте с времето. Корелацията показва, че две неща се движат заедно. Тя не доказва, че едното причинява другото.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-[15px]\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-sm text-muted\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Показател</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Посока</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Сила</th><th class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">r</th><th class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">Години</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/doctors\">Лекари</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в обратни посоки</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">умерена</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">-0,54</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2011<!-- -->–<!-- -->2020<!-- --> (<!-- -->10<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/health_gov_spending\">Държавни разходи за здраве</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">слаба</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,44</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">1996<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->29<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gov_revenue\">Приходи на държавата</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">слаба</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,42</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">1996<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->29<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gov_expenditure\">Разходи на държавата</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">в една посока</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">слаба</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,42</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">1996<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->29<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/out_of_pocket\">Разходи за здраве от джоба на пациента</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">няма ясна</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">почти няма</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">-0,3</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2012<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->13<!-- -->)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/house_prices\">Поскъпване на жилищата</a></td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">няма ясна</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\">почти няма</td><td class=\"py-2 pr-3 num\">0,3</td><td class=\"py-2 num hidden sm:table-cell\">2007<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> (<!-- -->18<!-- -->)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mb-10\">Източник: Евростат, набор <a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/gov_10a_exp/default/table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">gov_10a_exp</a> (<a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/statistics/1.0/data/gov_10a_exp?format=JSON&amp;lang=EN&amp;cofog99=GF04&amp;na_item=TE&amp;sector=S13&amp;unit=PC_GDP&amp;geo=BG&amp;geo=EU27_2020&amp;geo=RO&amp;geo=GR&amp;geo=HR&amp;geo=PL&amp;geo=HU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">заявката, от която са взети числата</a>).</p><section><div class=\"flex items-end justif